cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Reservation pricing and availability control with reinforcement learning"
authors:
  - name: "jjd-lab"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jjd-lab/revenue-manage-rl"
abstract: >-
  A two-lever revenue-management environment (price and selling limit over a
  100-day booking window for a fictional 10,000-seat amphitheater), classical
  baselines, Stable-Baselines3 agents, a control layer that can hold the second
  lever, and a soft-day-aware evaluation protocol. All demand data is synthetic.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - revenue management
  - dynamic pricing
  - overbooking
